{"4928980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Climb It Up", "steam_appid": 4928980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/5f1c32e4fac729ce8dcfe887cdc75252.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/5f1c32e4fac729ce8dcfe887cdc75252.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/5f1c32e4fac729ce8dcfe887cdc75252.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb It Up is a vertical dungeon-climbing adventure built around movement, rewards, and co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 4 players as you climb a dangerous magical tower filled with broken bridges, hanging prison cells, unstable energy, corrupted enemies, treasure rooms, and deadly vertical paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb, swing, fight, loot, and survive together — or fall because someone made one terrible decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/aea110d9637080013560bad4d9e2b1a7.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/aea110d9637080013560bad4d9e2b1a7.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/aea110d9637080013560bad4d9e2b1a7.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor is built around vertical traversal. Scale walls, leap between ledges, dolphin-jump across broken platforms, swing over deadly gaps, and climb through suspended dungeon structures as you push higher into the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: keep moving up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem is your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE POWERFUL REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/2d31996ab90ec71eb2fbcd310b7ce3d2.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/2d31996ab90ec71eb2fbcd310b7ce3d2.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/2d31996ab90ec71eb2fbcd310b7ce3d2.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open reward totems and chests to change the way your run plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose movement tools, combat upgrades, and useful abilities that help you cross dangerous gaps, defeat enemies, reach hidden treasure, or save a run that is already going very badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully. One reward can make the next climb easier. The wrong one can turn the whole team into a disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWING, JUMP, AND SURVIVE THE ABYSS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/c84ed67ab51ec8c9773477bfe40f6c66.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/c84ed67ab51ec8c9773477bfe40f6c66.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/c84ed67ab51ec8c9773477bfe40f6c66.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use grappling hooks to swing across impossible gaps, recover from mistakes, reach distant ledges, or create completely new problems for everyone behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb It Up is not just about reaching the next platform. It is about doing it under pressure, with enemies nearby, friends in the way, and the abyss waiting below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT CORRUPTED ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/34d1c5afba0a1895a34f6a1842693558.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/34d1c5afba0a1895a34f6a1842693558.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/34d1c5afba0a1895a34f6a1842693558.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tower is not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight corrupted skeletons, magicians, and other enemies as you climb through broken prison floors, unstable archives, and dangerous chambers. Use melee weapons, ranged attacks, magic tools, and movement to survive each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is not separate from climbing. Enemies attack while you are trying to move, jump, swing, and reach the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISK IT FOR TREASURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/7c5d5e7ccfe12c2b22c888568825cef8.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/7c5d5e7ccfe12c2b22c888568825cef8.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/7c5d5e7ccfe12c2b22c888568825cef8.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some paths are safe. Others lead to treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search optional routes, open hidden chests, and decide with your team whether to escape safely or risk everything for one more reward. The best loot is rarely on the safest path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR SOLO PLAY AND CO-OP CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone and master the movement at your own pace, or bring your friends and turn every climb into a test of coordination, timing, greed, and trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player can save the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player can ruin everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usually, it is the same player.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/5f1c32e4fac729ce8dcfe887cdc75252.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/5f1c32e4fac729ce8dcfe887cdc75252.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/5f1c32e4fac729ce8dcfe887cdc75252.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb It Up is a vertical dungeon-climbing adventure built around movement, rewards, and co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 4 players as you climb a dangerous magical tower filled with broken bridges, hanging prison cells, unstable energy, corrupted enemies, treasure rooms, and deadly vertical paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb, swing, fight, loot, and survive together — or fall because someone made one terrible decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/aea110d9637080013560bad4d9e2b1a7.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/aea110d9637080013560bad4d9e2b1a7.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/aea110d9637080013560bad4d9e2b1a7.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor is built around vertical traversal. Scale walls, leap between ledges, dolphin-jump across broken platforms, swing over deadly gaps, and climb through suspended dungeon structures as you push higher into the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: keep moving up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem is your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE POWERFUL REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/2d31996ab90ec71eb2fbcd310b7ce3d2.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/2d31996ab90ec71eb2fbcd310b7ce3d2.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/2d31996ab90ec71eb2fbcd310b7ce3d2.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open reward totems and chests to change the way your run plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose movement tools, combat upgrades, and useful abilities that help you cross dangerous gaps, defeat enemies, reach hidden treasure, or save a run that is already going very badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully. One reward can make the next climb easier. The wrong one can turn the whole team into a disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWING, JUMP, AND SURVIVE THE ABYSS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/c84ed67ab51ec8c9773477bfe40f6c