tack while you are trying to move, jump, swing, and reach the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISK IT FOR TREASURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/7c5d5e7ccfe12c2b22c888568825cef8.poster.avif?t=1785775983\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/7c5d5e7ccfe12c2b22c888568825cef8.webm?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/extras/7c5d5e7ccfe12c2b22c888568825cef8.mp4?t=1785775983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some paths are safe. Others lead to treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search optional routes, open hidden chests, and decide with your team whether to escape safely or risk everything for one more reward. The best loot is rarely on the safest path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR SOLO PLAY AND CO-OP CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone and master the movement at your own pace, or bring your friends and turn every climb into a test of coordination, timing, greed, and trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player can save the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player can ruin everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usually, it is the same player.</p>", "short_description": "Climb It Up is a chaotic solo/4-player co-op climbing dungeon game. Dolphin-jump, climb, swing with grappling hooks, choose powerful rewards, fight corrupted enemies, and try not to drag your friends into the abyss.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/b4d1ec435f76f99ea57ab93d07cefab609198287/header.jpg?t=1785775983", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/dde25bcd13c707213b99347174c61e41aa5b1700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785775983", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/dde25bcd13c707213b99347174c61e41aa5b1700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785775983", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> tbd<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> tbd<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["TeamBravo"], "publishers": ["TeamBravo"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928980/8dfed362e4b1c6b2cd06cdc0270aafe972e1383f/ss_8dfed362e4b1c6b2cd06cdc0270aafe972e1383f.600x338.jpg?t=1785775983", "path_full": "https://shar